{{!
    @template tool_mobile/site_blocked_message_textemail

    Plain text email template for the site being blocked from the standard Moodle app because of its hosting provider.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading
    * intro
    * body
    * footernote
    * buttonlabel
    * buttonurl

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "The Moodle mobile app isn't available with your site",
        "intro": "You're receiving this email because you're an administrator of My Test Moodle.",
        "body": "Students can only use the Moodle mobile app with your site when your hosting provider supports it.",
        "footernote": "This is managed by your hosting provider.",
        "buttonlabel": "Learn more",
        "buttonurl": "https://docs.moodle.org/en/Moodle_app_plans"
    }
}}
{{{intro}}}

{{{heading}}}

{{{body}}}

{{{buttonlabel}}}: {{{buttonurl}}}

{{{footernote}}}
